0000                  (            os9.d):00152         F$Link              RMB       1                   Link to Module
0001                  (            os9.d):00153         F$Load              RMB       1                   Load Module from File
0002                  (            os9.d):00154         F$UnLink            RMB       1                   Unlink Module
0003                  (            os9.d):00155         F$Fork              RMB       1                   Start New Process
0004                  (            os9.d):00156         F$Wait              RMB       1                   Wait for Child Process to Die
0005                  (            os9.d):00157         F$Chain             RMB       1                   Chain Process to New Module
0006                  (            os9.d):00158         F$Exit              RMB       1                   Terminate Process
0007                  (            os9.d):00159         F$Mem               RMB       1                   Set Memory Size
0008                  (            os9.d):00160         F$Send              RMB       1                   Send Signal to Process
0009                  (            os9.d):00161         F$Icpt              RMB       1                   Set Signal Intercept
000A                  (            os9.d):00162         F$Sleep             RMB       1                   Suspend Process
000B                  (            os9.d):00163         F$SSpd              RMB       1                   Suspend Process
000C                  (            os9.d):00164         F$ID                RMB       1                   Return Process ID
000D                  (            os9.d):00165         F$SPrior            RMB       1                   Set Process Priority
000E                  (            os9.d):00166         F$SSWI              RMB       1                   Set Software Interrupt
000F                  (            os9.d):00167         F$PErr              RMB       1                   Print Error
