0034                  (            os9.d):00231         F$AllRAM            RMB       1                   Allocate RAM blocks
0034                  (            os9.d):00232         F$AllImg            RMB       1                   Allocate Image RAM blocks
0034                  (            os9.d):00233         F$DelImg            RMB       1                   Deallocate Image RAM blocks
0034                  (            os9.d):00234         F$SetImg            RMB       1                   Set Process DAT Image
