                      (        xcom9.asm):00023         *
                      (        xcom9.asm):00024         * Revision History -
                      (        xcom9.asm):00025         *        Nov 17 84 version 1 - no xmodem support - no signals
                      (        xcom9.asm):00026         *        Jan 20 85 version 2 - added vuflg and acia read ahead on mdm
                      (        xcom9.asm):00027         *        Feb 15 85 version 3 - major rewrite to add xmodem support
                      (        xcom9.asm):00028         *        MAR 15 85 version 4 - prompt mode for send added
                      (        xcom9.asm):00029         *        APR  8 85 version 5 - added break command/finished xmodem
                      (        xcom9.asm):00030         *                            - sent to users group
                      (        xcom9.asm):00031         *        Feb  1 88 version 6 - added set baud & parity command(The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00032         *        Feb  1 88 version 7 - added definable ascii filter   (The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00033         *        Mar  1 88 version 8 - added overlay windows on level2(The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00034         *        Mar  4 88 version 9 - added auto redial              (The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00035         *        May 11 88 version 10- Macro keys                     (The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00036         *        May 15 88 version 11- Change directory               (The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00037         *                  "           Add/Strip line feed
                      (        xcom9.asm):00038         *        Dec 29 88 revision 1- Fixed send break.
                      (        xcom9.asm):00039         *                              Fixed position dependency port bug.
                      (        xcom9.asm):00040         *                                                             (The Doctor)
                      (        xcom9.asm):00041         *        May 24 89 version 12  added ymodem/xmodem crc support
                      (        xcom9.asm):00042         *                              fixed 1200 baud ctrl code bug  (The Doctor)
     000C             (        xcom9.asm):00043         version  equ   12
